uthern  border and the human smugglers who get  them there and beyond  already this fiscal year u.s customs and  border protection has recorded more than  1.5 million encounters in the southwest  nearly the same amount as all of 2021  we don't know where that trailer was  headed but we're just a few hundred  yards from i-35 interstate highway which  starts at the texas-mexico border and  goes all the way up to minnesota it is a  known smugglers room investigators with  department of homeland security are here  on the scene and they are now leading  this investigation nate  omar thank you
 

